Actually should we move 

```
nodeInfos, _ := pl.sharedLister.NodeInfos().List()
		for _, nodeInfo := range nodeInfos {
			// (1) Ensure the node matches the incoming Pod's node selector/affinity, if specified.
			if !pluginhelper.PodMatchesNodeSelectorAndAffinityTerms(pod, nodeInfo.Node()) {
				continue
			}
```

and

```
for _, existingPod := range nodeInfo.Pods() {
				if existingPod.Namespace != pod.Namespace {
					continue
				}
```

out of `for _, c := range constraints` to get a pre-filtered pod list first. Suppose has huge node and several constraints, time complexity would increase a lot due to call `pluginhelper.PodMatchesNodeSelectorAndAffinityTerms(pod, nodeInfo.Node()` every time.
